# patched_dep comes from the registry checked in next to this file, so the
# fixture needs no network for the module under test. The archive it serves can
# only be named by an absolute file:// URL, so the test writes
# registry/modules/patched_dep/1.0.0/source.json (and zips registry/src/) after
# copying the fixture; see support::publish_local_registry. Everything else
# (bazel_tools' own deps) still resolves through the BCR.
common --registry=file://%workspace%/registry
common --registry=https://bcr.bazel.build
